es</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hit notes to build up your your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete for the top spot in the leaderboards for official and community-made songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create and share your own charts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play against your friends with the multiplayer mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Import charts from your existing PPD install using the PPD manager tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with the included songs from top artists from popular eurobeat circles such as <strong>SuganoMusic </strong>and <strong>Galaxian Recordings</strong> or from independent artists like <strong>Odyssey Eurobeat, with a total of more than 25 songs, with more to come!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> support, play the existing 2000+ community-made charts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > UI skinning!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note skinning!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full FFmpeg integration, so you can use video files in your custom songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge yourself with the higher difficulty songs!</p></li></ul>","developers":["EIRTeam"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1216230/38d3c88b240420e5bc76444e9ad0256227e550a7/header.jpg?t=1766272826","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2020-2026 \u00c1lex Rom\u00e1n N\u00fa\u00f1ez","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> A distribution that supports Steam<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A fast GPU that has Vulkan support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available